                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In Trump\u2019s America, billionaires get more tax breaks while hardworking families lose their health insurance & pay more at the grocery store.\n\nNevadans deserve better. That\u2019s why I\u2019ll keep fighting to prevent a massive spike in health care costs.",
