                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A Las Vegas small business owner in their early 60s, making $68,000 a year and buying insurance through Nevada Health Link, will see their monthly premium more than double next year.\n\nThis isn\u2019t hypothetical. It\u2019s a painful reality millions of American families are facing because Washington Republicans need to reopen the government and stop this massive cost hike.",
