                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump and Washington Republicans passed the biggest Medicaid cuts in history, taking health care coverage away from millions of families.\n\nNow, they want to make it harder for older Americans to qualify for Social Security or afford Medicare \u2013 all while billionaires get more tax breaks.",
