                "retweet_count": 28,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A family of four in Reno making $90,000 will have to pay OVER $9,000 MORE for their health insurance premiums next year.\n\nThat could be a year of groceries. It could be a used car or a few months of day care.\n\nWashington Republicans need to put the American people first and stop this life-altering price hike.",
