                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump wants his own Justice Dept. to pay him $230 million in taxpayer money \u2013 and his former personal attorney who now works at the DOJ would be the one to sign off on it.\n\nMillions of Americans are trying to figure out how they\u2019re going to afford health insurance next year, and Trump is trying to figure out how he can put more money in his own pocket. Unbelievable.",
