                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nevada families can\u2019t go into next year with no plan for how they\u2019ll afford health insurance.\n\nWashington Republicans should put the Americans they serve first and negotiate a deal to stop this huge spike in costs. https://t.co/9XptybRSZz",
